     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Contact details",
     "texto": [
      "**Numer telefonu** means «phone number». In Polish, the second noun takes the genitive: **numer telefonu** (literally «number of telephone»)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Numbers",
     "texto": [
      "To read long numbers, split the digits into groups. In writing, **plus** comes before the international prefix; country names keep their declined forms."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
